Conceptual photography: Island of the colorblind by Sanne de Wilde

5 February 2018
| No Comments
/ Categories: The Blessedlist

Conceptual photography: Island of the colorblind by Sanne de Wilde


05-02-2018
Conceptually strong photography project by Sanne de Wilde (NOOR Images) on the topic of color blindness. Sanne combines photography, art and installation to allow the viewer and visitor to experience achromatopsia. This series was one of the winner of the Dutch storytelling award of ‘Zilveren Camera’.

Watch Island of the colorblind by Sanne de Wilde

