Where’s Mei Zuling? She’s very dissatisfied with Pi two dog’s eccentricity, but she’s moping away.

22, 7 月 2024
Where’s Mei Zuling? She’s very dissatisfied with Pi two dog’s eccentricity, but she’s moping away.

Not long after, Pi two dog’s mobile phone received an incoming text message, originally from Weng Chuncao, with a payment of 300,000 yuan. So far, the total amount of Pi two dog Bank has exceeded 3.5 million yuan.
Plus, if the second batch of Zoyang pills is shipped today, the total amount of other money will reach 4 million yuan!
It’s so cool to think that the more money he earns in his pocket, the more excitement he can hide, the more money he can make, especially the more money he can make!
At this time, Jiang Xuemei was in charge of paying wages to the vegetable pickers. He came home all the way to see Liu Wen, who jumped out of nowhere and stopped him. "Brother Dog, I heard that you bought the white wine factory. Is it true that the boss is you?"
Shrimp? This girl’s news is so clever
When I asked him about the goods, I admitted, "Yes, I bid with that Sun Tiewang, and finally I spent 20 million to win the bid!" After this, Pi two dog realized that he had lied and said, Oh, my God, what’s the matter? I’m possessed. Spent 10 million. Where did the 2 million come from?
But if you spill it, you can’t get it back.
"Shrimp? A closed factory will cost 20 million? Oh, my God. Didn’t you say 3 million? " Liu Wen suspicious looking at skin two dog way
"First, Lao Zhang’s price was 3 million. Later, when Boss Sun saw us jumping in, he rushed to set up a factory and raised the purchase price to 10 million plus 3 million to pay dividends to the government. Later, when I participated in the auction, the super high price reached 20 million!" This guy looks like an ancient well.
"I don’t believe in taking the contract!"
Listen to her to see the contract. two dog has to take out the contract. When Liu Wen saw the contract, he jumped up and said, "Isn’t the dog brother fifteen million? Adding 3 million dividends is also 10 million. There are still 2 million for you to eat? "
"Liu Wen, you are so mean, and there are 2 million hidden kickbacks, you know?" There is no such thing as a kickback, but it is rare for Pi two dog to continue to play careless.
"Well, that’s more like it! That dog brother, I paid 10 million yuan, and you also paid 10 million yuan. How can our family be divided? " Liu Wen finally got to the point.
Chapter 126 Jiang Xiaoying worry
Speaking of the problem of sharing, Pi two dog thought about it and said in a tone of discussion, "How about Wenwen’s wine-making results have not come out yet, and then we can talk about the problem of sharing after the experiment is successful?"
"I can’t. If you fail in the experiment, will I lose 10 million yuan?" Liu Wen a face of Meng than looking at skin two dog way
"I won’t compensate you for the loss if you don’t make good wine!" Pi two dog said that if Liu Wen’s 10 million white wine factory hadn’t sold out early, people would be willing to support him with such a large sum of money. He couldn’t be ungrateful to Thaksin, not to mention that he had the strong backing of anti-fate food and anti-fate medicinal materials. If the wine-making experiment really didn’t succeed, he could afford 10 million.
"ah? That’s 10 million dog brothers. Do you really pay for it? " Liu Wen was stunned.
"Don’t you believe me? Why don’t we sign an agreement?" He looked at Liu Wendao with a serious look on his face.
Listening to him talking about this busy Liu Wen is waving his hand and saying, "Brother Dog, I believe you won’t sign the agreement!"
Besides, Jiang Xiaoying came to Baiyang town with a Maserati after receiving the arrival notice of Brandon. She had never been to Baiyang town and asked for directions before she found the door lock of Brandon pharmacy. Jiang Xiaoying was shocked to see that there was a long queue in front of Brandon pharmacy to buy Zoyang pills.
Prynne was heartbroken when she saw that the pharmacy life was so prosperous. The purchase price of Zoyang pills was 300 yuan per pill, but she made room for 600 yuan per pill and 1000 pills. After deducting the achievement of 500 thousand and sharing it with Uncle Big Egg, she made a net profit of more than 200 thousand!
What’s even more incredible is that Pi two dog Suoyang Pill has also driven its drug sales. The opposite Huang Liang pharmacy is deserted, which forms a fresh contrast with Bailan pharmacy’s popularity. Huang Liang, who was jealous and watched Bailan count his money, got cramps, but he couldn’t do anything about it. Besides, Caihuahuayuan Pharmacy also entered Suoyang Pill, which was also a queuing scene.
Seeing Huang Liang staring at the door, Prynne felt a little sympathy for him, saying that it was a close call. Fortunately, Pi two dog saved my life all the time, otherwise our field would be worse than Huang Liang’s.
"Brandon, wow, your business is good!" Jiang Xiaoying appeared out of nowhere in the chaotic crowd
As soon as Prynne saw Jiang Xiaoying, she warmly invited her to the office and excitedly said, "Sister Xiaoying, I’ll keep the Zoyang pills for you!" And she gave Jiang Xiaoying two packed Zoyang pills.
"Look at the packaging, it’s a bit crude, but things are good things!" Jiang Xiaoying readily made up the balance.
"Sister Xiaoying, you have a good opinion. I’ll ask the boss to customize a batch of tin boxes another day so that it can be graded!" Brandon said it was a good idea. People spent 600 yuan on decent packaging, and it was really inappropriate to customize a small tin box to print beautiful patterns. It didn’t take much.
"Prynne, who sent this Zoyang pill? Many people in nine planets are asking about it now! " Jiang Xiaoying said that this thing is believed that many men dream of finding the boss who produces this medicine to talk to him. After all, it is only when she manages the Miao pharmaceutical factory that it can be produced on a large scale.
"Xiaoying, I’m sorry. I said this before. I want to keep it a secret!" Prynne said it was lucky that she was the first to sign an exclusive agreement with Brother Dog. Otherwise, Jiang Xiaoying’s pharmaceutical factory would definitely find Brother Dog, and she wouldn’t be so profitable when Zoyang pills were mass-produced then.
Yes, she is most afraid of Jiang Xiaoying reaching out to Pi two dog. If it is a pharmaceutical factory, she is afraid that there is a special clause in the agreement that Pi two dog is not allowed to cooperate with other manufacturers to produce the same kind of pills. This is a double-skin and double-head spell that can protect her interests to the greatest extent.
Of course, it is no problem for Pi two dog to produce Zoyang pills in his own factory, because if he produces more, he can also give her goods.
Jiang Xiaoying couldn’t ask anything from Prynne’s mouth. She left Prynne’s pharmacy to see the sun setting west. She suddenly thought of Pi two dog, also a native of Baiyang Town. Who produced Zoyang Pills and asked Pi two dog if he must know.
Thinking of this, Jiang Xiaoying came over with a word and said, "two dog has something good for you. Come to town quickly!"
When Pi two dog learned about Jiang Xiaoying’s town, he asked Tian Huili Xiang to rush to Baiyang Town to meet Jiang Xiaoying. After Jiang Xiaoying rushed out, he said, "two dog, what is this?"
Tian Huili Xiang was dumbfounded when she saw Zoyang Pill in her hand.
Pi two dog is also a face of stupid than playing dumb. "Xiaoying, what is this? Why don’t I know? "
"This is Zoyang Pill! All men like babies. Let me give you one! " Xiao-ying Jiang saw that his goods were so pathetic that he said that two dog was so pathetic. He didn’t even know Zoyang Pill, and he said that he would ask him, which seemed hopeless.
"So this is Zoyang Pill? I heard that this thing can treat men’s dysfunction worse than Wei Ge! " Pi two dog installed a comparison.
"Many men in two dog have said yes. Do you know who developed Zoyang Pill?" Xiao-ying Jiang blushing looked at him and said
"ah? Xiaoying, why do you ask this? "
"two dog Dajun Pharmaceutical Factory wants to show its depth with the maker of Zoyang Pills. He is a large factory with more than 1,000 people. The advanced production equipment can realize large-scale production. By then, Zoyang Pills will not only be a small place, but also be promoted to the country and exported overseas!" Jiang Xiaoying said that this is a once-in-a-lifetime business opportunity. The Miao pharmaceutical factory has reached a bottleneck. Although her management has achieved the goal of doubling the annual output value, Miao pharmaceutical factory does not have its own main medicine and exclusive knowledge to produce patented drugs.
It’s dangerous to go like this. Jiang Xiaoying has been looking for a breakthrough. If it can be said that the two parties of Zoyang Pills share in the dividend, it will be a win-win situation to change Zoyang Pills from small-scale production to modern large-scale production. Jiang Xiaoying almost drooled at the thought of selling Zoyang Pills and making a lot of money.
"Sister Xiaoying, I know this person, but this person is very low-key and can’t come out to meet people. He signed an exclusive goods agreement with the proprietress of Bailan Pharmacy. There are special clauses in the agreement that it is not allowed to co-produce with other manufacturers unless he owns his own factory!" Pi two dog’s heart says it’s a joke. Oh, Miao Dajun’s show off in an ostentatious manner is now hanging badly. If Zoyang Pill is given to him for production, he will die.
"Ah?" Listening to Pi two dog’s serious words, Jiang Xiaoying is also blindsided. Oh, my God, what a good business opportunity it is that Brandon has robbed it. Thinking about Jiang Xiaoying first, he suddenly wondered, "Who is the research and development of Suoyang Pill in two dog?"
"I said that I developed it. Do you believe it?" Pi two dog looked at Jiang Xiaoying’s way to play around.
In Jiang Xiaoying’s eyes, Pi two dog is a vagrant who lives by fooling women. Pi two dog said this, and she didn’t believe it at all. "two dog, don’t be such a joke, ok? Tell me who this awesome person really is? "
"Well, his name is Wang Langjun! Only Prynne knows that he has fallen, and most people can’t find him! " He said something, and to be honest, no one believed him.
"Wang Langjun? Which village is he? " Xiao-ying jiang don’t lose heart way

